+---
+id: task-002-implement-json-patch-applypatch-rfc-6902
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Patch applyPatch (RFC 6902)"
+status: pending
+---
+
+## What was done
+
+Added `applyPatch(document, patch)` in `src/index.ts` (RFC 6902: add, remove, replace, move, copy, test),
+with tests in `test/patch.test.ts` (written first; includes the RFC appendix A examples, error paths,
+non-mutation and prototype safety). `resolvePointer` now shares a pointer parser with it; its behaviour is unchanged.
+Decisions: see dl-002-json-patch-application-semantics-for-applypatch.
